+#
+# Commands listed here are still permitted to return a bare `String` or `bool`
+# instead of the canonical `Result<T, IpcError>` envelope. Every entry except
+# `is_tunnel_open` is *legacy debt* scheduled for migration — see the H-3
+# migration checklist. Removing an entry (after migrating it) is always fine.
+# ADDING a new bare String/bool command makes scripts/check-ipc-contract.sh fail.
+#
+# Format: one command name per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
+
+# --- genuine boolean value (NOT a success flag) — permanently allowed ---
+is_tunnel_open
+
+# --- legacy String payloads (JSON-as-string) — migrate to Result<String, IpcError> ---
+execute_query
+list_connections
+query_file
+get_file_schema
+get_history
+import_dbeaver_connections
+get_activity
+kill_session
+
+# --- legacy bool success flags — migrate to Result<(), IpcError> (symmetric pair) ---
+store_credential
+delete_credential
